stateDiagram-v2
  [*] --> Night
  Night --> Night: unfinished dingdongs / cannot sleep
  Night --> SleepTransition: all night events completed / Change
  SleepTransition --> Day: InitNewDay / Day plus 1 / actions refill
  Day --> Day: energy > 0 / cannot sleep
  Day --> EnergySpent: energy-tagged option / Act
  EnergySpent --> Day: actions remain
  EnergySpent --> SleepTransition: actions <= 0 / Change
  SleepTransition --> Night: InitNewNight / generate visitors
  SleepTransition --> Dream: NeedToShowDream
  Dream --> SleepTransition: dream ends
